  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xE4;r en upphandlingsrevision av SNV f&#xF6;r perioden januari 2020 till december 2021. Syftet &#xE4;r att bed&#xF6;ma SNV:s efterlevnad n&#xE4;r det g&#xE4;ller upphandlingsprocesser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a procurement audit of SNV for the period January 2020 to  December 2021. The purpose is to assess compliance of SNV with regards to procurement processes.</narrative>
  </description>
